      },
      "message": "feat(catalog): add example catalog infrastructure and 2d/first-part seed\n\nAdd `cam.call(tool, args?)` and `.camscript` support so catalog scripts\nbuild projects headlessly through undoable MCP commands.\nAdd `examples/catalog/<family>/<case>/` seeded with `2d/first-part`,\n`crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs`, `crates/ui/tests/catalog_render.rs`,\nand `cargo xtask catalog` (`--check`, `--screenshots`, `--with-guide`, `--pdf`).\n\nProcess change: yes\nFixes #2393",
